# Water molecule: projection-free guess from the cc-pVTZ density of
# H2O_tz_pbe in the aug-cc-pVDZ basis
System H2O.xyz
Method gga_x_pbe-gga_c_pbe
Basis aug-cc-pVDZ
Direct false
IntegralThresh 1e-14

LoadChk H2O_tz_pbe.chk
Guess ProjFree
Logfile H2O_projfree_pbe.log
SaveChk H2O_projfree_pbe.chk
BasisRotate false
DFTGrid 50 -194
